**Definition 8.3 (conditions for a source/action/risk/resource bridge).** The following correspondences are required for a transfer that preserves this prediction task.

| Coordinate | Sparse-tree supplier | Original stopped predictor | Required bridge |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Source | One finite ordered tree and actual executed substitutions | One depth drawn before Reads and the common conditional iid law | One declared joint realization, not matching symbol names |
| Operation | Global same-register substitution, literal address Read, Halt | Paid letter Read, original parser/record update, matching Stop | Preservation of permissions, version binding and original event blocks |
| Update | Deterministic $\rho$ on the actual tree | Stochastic private $B,A$ used on acquired letters and in decoder synthesis | Correspondence of the joint reply/successor kernels, including the blind direction |
