No tree, literal address or $\mathsf{ApplyRho}$ is added to the original observer here. No current-tree depth is equated with $K$ or with the number of paid Reads. The added serial contract is not claimed to be implemented by original immutable acquisition. [JM, Sections 36–39 and 65] already distinguishes intrinsic maximal inverse depth, actual entrance, effective initialized history and their charged evidence; its complete-tree or entrance certificates do not identify the present acquired kernels.

The original dynamic future quotient [DFQ, qualifications Q1–Q6] concerns exact true residual laws and legal active histories. Its static five-mode plus dynamic-history synthesis requires a shared source and response kernel. This construction instead varies the installed predictor's private kernel on one fixed actual source. It neither contradicts that scoped quotient nor reproduces its infinite-quotient argument. The recursive five-window interfaces in [FIB, Section 240] retain their own seams, arithmetic source, operation directions and budget obligations. No classification of arbitrary trained networks is asserted.

